nstitutes will not allow women into some courses has triggered debate. Critics worry it may be a sign that the new Syrian government is restricting women's rights.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>AI company Anthropic files its IPO in hopes of raising $100 billion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:36a71a07860b325ba257e321d05ac06f7ee663b71b53b646edcff4cee3e7da30</id><updated>2026-10-26T21:06:54Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T18:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ai-company-anthropic-files-its-ipo-in-hopes-of-raising-100-billion/a-79768876--0dae568d3f2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ai-company-anthropic-files-its-ipo-in-hopes-of-raising-100-billion/a-79768876?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Anthropic has filed paperwork for an initial public offering that could be one of the biggest in history. The company has yet to turn a profit.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German police probe cruise ship captain after Bremerhaven collision</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8216eb6a15cdba2b04229d9943a2392e2a5ff6e92e15094957cd540bfe69c803</id><updated>2026-10-26T21:06:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T17:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-cruise-ship-captain-after-bremerhaven-collision/a-79769346--ffe109304bf6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-cruise-ship-captain-after-bremerhaven-collision/a-79769346?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A three-ship collision has led to the cancellation of a cruise and expensive damages. Shipyard repairs are needed, and further cruises could be affected.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What Germany thinks of carmaker Audi's $4 billion deal with Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f01f3b5d2a5d4453e9e19f9d05e6d1052dbabdde0c26f2b228f604d8baaa4035</id><update